(7620047, 1234321, 124815, '<td valign="top">A lot to take in here - an interesting and arresting image.<br/>But there are one too many things. IMO the woman with glasses is superfluous</td>', 'A lot to take in here - an interesting and arresting image.But there are one too many things. IMO the woman with glasses is superfluous', '2019-03-16 14:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7620048, 1234314, 124815, '<td valign="top">This must be another open eye dream that Alex had in and above Dubai. I can feel the landing moment approaching</td>', 'This must be another open eye dream that Alex had in and above Dubai. I can feel the landing moment approaching', '2019-03-16 14:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7620049, 1234236, 124815, '<td valign="top">There is a lot to learn from the cats'' behaviour. Such as staring at a closed window in perfect silence and comfort.</td>', 'There is a lot to learn from the cats'' behaviour. Such as staring at a closed window in perfect silence and comfort.', '2019-03-16 14:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7620051, 1233635, 124815, '<td valign="top">A Margaret production - The dancing elements from Klimt that appear on some of your images are interesting. The 2 characters on the connecting arch are definitely not needed imo, way too oversized and not matching the rest - perhaps if you make them smaller and sort of pulverized...</td>', 'A Margaret production - The dancing elements from Klimt that appear on some of your images are interesting. The 2 characters on the connecting arch are definitely not needed imo, way too oversized and not matching the rest - perhaps if you make them smaller and sort of pulverized...', '2019-03-16 14:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
